WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.550
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:20.640
If I'd just run,
this wouldn't have happened.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.100
But...

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:27.520
I couldn't just abandon my work.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.780
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:22.780
Don't appear... Don't appear...

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.240
Of all the dumb luck!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:57.320
Return my fields...

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:12.230
Return my fields!

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:17.650
Return my fields!

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:25.660
CHAPTER 54

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:30.640
DOROTABO, LIFE AND EARTH

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.590
Dorotabo?

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:35.520
Yeah.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.520
DOROTABO

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:41.510
A farmer struggled to
cultivate rough land.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.930
Finally, he was able to grow rice.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.060
But his son was a drunkard,

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:49.500
and the fields were sold.

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:54.150
Having died in grief, that farmer
appears night after night

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.130
moaning, "return my fields"
again and again.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:58.690
Same as now.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:03.570
The Dorotabo's mad that you're
messing up his land.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:07.140
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.190
A <i>yokai</i> prevents your work.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:21.190
But your superiors only tell you to
stay on schedule.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.840
You workers have it tough.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.340
You must be uneasy.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.910
That's where I come in!

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.810
BIBIBI NO RAT MAN

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:32.140
There's a <i>yokai</i> exterminating expert
called Kitaro.

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.670
Obviously, he won't work for free, but...

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.530
We've got three available price plans...

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:44.450
President Kurosu!

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.880
P-President?

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.530
Hello, Mr. President.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:53.140
Our best plan includes <i>yokai</i>
extermination and counseling.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:57.270
I'll even throw in
a signed photo of Kitaro...

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:08.800
Never show your face again!

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.990
Ow, ow! Ow! Ow!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.520
I said, ow!

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:16.400
Be more gentle!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:17.270
Ouch!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.130
Stop being a fussy patient!

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:23.990
Thirty years ago, those rice fields
were made into a golf course.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:29.260
Having lost popularity, now they're
turning it into a mega-solar power plant.

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:32.660
I get why the Dorotabo's mad.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:40.040
Wait. Wasn't there trouble between
the Dorotabo and humans 30 years ago?

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.460
Kitaro?

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.630
I'm going for a walk.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.410
Let's call it off!

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:58.520
Ten people have run away already!

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:03.280
Everyone's afraid to touch land
where a <i>yokai</i> appears.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:08.840
Is that all you've got to say?!

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:14.260
I've had it!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:26.090
You!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.490
It's been 30 years.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:42.650
So, 30 years ago...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:47.550
The Dorotabo went on a rampage
trying to slaughter the humans.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.260
Unable to ignore it, Kitaro...

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:00.500
Return...

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:04.440
my...

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.380
fields...

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:17.350
H-He did it!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.410
The monster's dead!

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:21.710
-We can get back to work!
-Yeah!

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:23.520
We've won!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.340
That's enough!

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:34.830
The Dorotabo only wanted to
protect his fields.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:38.290
Nothing changes with you humans.

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:42.370
You act like you own this world.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:46.110
I never should have helped you!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.600
Kitaro, don't!

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.450
But, Dad...!

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:01.140
Don't!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:23.080
Three days later, my dad died.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:29.760
I'm sure you believe that's just
karma for our human arrogance.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.860
The Dorotabo's appeared.

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.640
Perhaps time healed his wounds.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:42.790
Or maybe his anger at
the redevelopment awoke him.

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.520
If you continue construction,
he will again...

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.610
The construction won't stop.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.780
So, what'll you do?

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.040
Will you exterminate the Dorotabo again?

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:04.980
Or will you
exterminate us humans this time?

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:29.190
Return my fields.

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:34.530
Return my fields.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:56.800
Return my fields.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:04.540
Show yourself, Dorotabo.

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:12.650
Return my fields!

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.170
DOROTABO

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:20.090
My fields!

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:22.510
Stop it! I'm here to talk!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:45.620
DOROTABO

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.120
KITARO AND DADDY EYEBALL

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.020
-<i>"No, no."</i>
-<i>"Oh, what should I do?"</i>

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.020
<i>"Look me in the eye and tell me."</i>

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.360
Kitaro.

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:57.570
This is your land.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.490
I understand your hate of the humans.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:03.120
But...

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:07.700
Dorotabo!

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.790
I'll get them to stop construction!

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.230
Give me time!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.500
Dorotabo!

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.800
Please, Dorotabo.

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:28.500
<i>A </i>yokai<i> has appeared at the mega-solar</i>
<i>plant construction site causing chaos.</i>

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.390
MYSTERY AT THE MEGA-SOLAR POWER PLANT

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.810
<i>We have unconfirmed reports of wounded...</i>

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:32.250
Dad.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:34.770
That's about your work, right?

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:36.360
Is there a ghost?

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:37.860
Ghosts don't exist.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:38.840
Liar!

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.320
I'm not lying.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.320
Even if they do...

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:50.540
Your dad's invincible!
I'll beat up any ghost!

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:59.360
What do you want to grow up to be?

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:02.720
A strong man like you, Dad!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:04.140
I see.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:30.450
That city is on the verge of
economic collapse.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.810
The power plant is their last hope.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.590
Plus a lot of money has already
gone into it.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:38.920
They can't cancel it now.

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:42.630
If they don't, someone will die.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:46.050
It could be you.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:50.470
What about your son?

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:57.150
With human and <i>yokai</i> positions
in conflict, whoever backs down loses.

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.530
It's not about winning or losing.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.070
You hate us <i>yokai</i>, don't you?

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:15.060
On his deathbed, my dad said...

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.750
I'm sorry.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:22.970
If I'd just run,
this wouldn't have happened.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:24.360
But...

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:26.390
Even so...

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:32.220
When I work digging up the earth
and driving in piles,

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:37.230
it's like I'm making your future
with my own hands.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.900
It feels that way.

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:42.960
And so...

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:48.450
I couldn't just abandon my work.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:55.460
Now that I've got a kid,
I understand what my dad meant.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.360
I'm making his future.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:05.740
I believe the world he'll live in
will be better for it.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.600
It doesn't matter if some <i>yokai</i> shows up.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:12.600
Even if I die.

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:17.900
I can't just run away.

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:27.070
<i>If you hadn't helped us,
we'd all have died back then.</i>

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:32.330
<i>I didn't want to say all that to you.
I'm grateful.</i>

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.660
<i>But what can you do?</i>

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:40.790
<i>This world ain't so simple
that we can all just get along.</i>

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.150
Back then, I...

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:47.260
I never should have helped you!

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.930
That's what I thought.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:55.350
"Humans are selfish.
They can't get along with <i>yokai</i>.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.750
Why bother trying?"

00:14:58.520 --> 00:14:59.600
But...

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.860
Now...

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:08.900
Thanks to my tipping off the press,
that redevelopment project's toxic.

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:11.570
It'll fall through on its own.

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.580
I'm so considerate.

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.950
You're just in it for money.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.390
<i>An update on the </i>yokai<i> trouble.</i>

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:25.150
<i>Apparently there was a death
at this location 30 years ago.</i>

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:30.970
<i>The rumor is spreading and reports say
construction may be forced to shut down.</i>

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.900
Return my fields.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:23.100
Return my fields!

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.800
It's been a long time.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.620
If you're waiting for me to run,
then give up.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:40.470
This place belongs to humans.
You're the one leaving!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.440
Well? Don't you hate humans?

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.320
Try spewing your favorite line again!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.570
Return...

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:58.580
my fields!

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:18.240
Yes!

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:19.990
Just as I thought!

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:22.680
You only show up at night!

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:28.460
And with that damp body...
Your weakness is heat!

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:36.030
Dorotabo!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:21.370
Looks like I've won.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:28.310
Shoot if you want.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.380
What?!

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:33.480
But human advancement won't stop.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.990
We'll dig and drive piles,
dig and drive piles,

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.880
and build our future!

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:42.760
My death stops nothing!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.890
No!

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:49.020
Dad!

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.150
Don't die!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:53.550
You followed me here?

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:17.670
Return my fields!

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:21.740
Return my fields!

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:27.220
Could it be this rain...?!

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:29.230
Return my fields!

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:33.480
Return my fields!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:37.590
Return my fields!

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:39.720
Return my fields!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:43.140
Return my fields!

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:45.740
Return my fields!

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.930
<i>Dorotabo...</i>

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:49.660
Return my fields!

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.520
Stop it.

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.020
Return my fields!

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.920
Please.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.300
Return my fields!

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:58.920
Return my fields!

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.410
Return my fields!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.080
Return my fields!

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:08.200
Return my fields!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.460
Stop...

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:19.030
Stop it!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.570
Thank you.

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:16.460
POWER PLANT CONSTRUCTION CANCELLED

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:26.260
NO TRESPASSING

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.330
Well, let's go.

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:31.350
Okay!

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>itsumade mo kono mama de imashou</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>You blur and begin to fade</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>kasuka kimi ga nijimu</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry
Where did you come from?</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry anata wa doko kara kitano?</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>A masquerade
Faceless faces laugh</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>kamenbutou kao no nai kao ga warau</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Hee-hee-hee</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>fufufu</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>In dreams, in dreams
Lost in dreams</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>yume ni yume ni yume ni samayoi</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>Twirling around</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>kuru kuru to mawaru</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>Everyone dancing, dancing
Looking for love</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>dare mo odoru odoru ai wo sagashite</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO, spin, spin
Dream, dream</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO mawareyo maware yume yume</i>

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:04.840
<i>A </i>yokai<i> enthusiastically coaches humans.</i>

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:07.970
<i>But, Dad, I don't think it'll work...</i>

00:23:08.340 --> 00:23:10.510
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:12.720
<i>"Hihi's Harassment Hell"</i>

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:15.350
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
